Uploads for Numina topics land here, put in place by /admin.

This file exists so the directory does. Git does not track empty directories,
and public/admin/config.yml points the Topics collection's media_folder at
this path — scripts/check-cms.mjs resolves that path and fails when it is
missing, which is what broke the first Numina deploy: verify passed on a
machine where the folder had been created by hand and failed in CI, where the
clone had never seen it.

Delete this once there is a real upload beside it, or leave it; it costs
nothing.
